# Fixture: a step behind `when level>=2` in a guide that starts at level 1
# (tests/playtest.test.js, --level-offset). The Ahead step's goto is on a map
# the game has no frame for: a character who starts a level ahead plays it and
# is stuck there; one at the guide's level skips it and plays the guide through.
guide ahead/northshire
title Ahead Fixture
faction Alliance
race Human
levels 1-6
zone Elwynn Forest

step Northshire Abbey
  goto 48.2,42.0 "Northshire Abbey"

step Ahead
  when level>=2
  goto 50,50 map 9999 "Nowhere"

step Abbey garden
  goto 50.6,40.2 "Abbey garden"
